# Deck layers

- Layer implementations are **classes** extending deck.gl `Layer` / `CompositeLayer` — expected here
- Keep picking helpers and props types next to the layer (`*.types.ts`, `picking.utils.ts`)
- Prefer existing Fourwings / vessel / context utilities over new ad-hoc loaders
- Composer resolution lives in `libs/deck-layer-composer` — change resolvers carefully; dataview IDs and visibility matter
- Avoid breaking public prop shapes without updating platform map wrappers and tests
- Run `pnpm nx test deck-layers` (or affected) after loader/layer logic changes
